---
layout: base.njk
title: The Playbooks
description: Deep-dive playbooks on sourcing ML, robotics, and quantum engineers. The full Proof of Work Sourcing methodology, role-family guides, and the 2026 AI tool scorecard.
permalink: /playbooks/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<header class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">§ the playbooks</div>
    <h1>The few guides<br>you'll <span class="si">actually use.</span></h1>
    <p class="lede">Deep-dive guides on a single role family or method at a time. Real queries, real proof points, real worked examples. Each one is a search you can run tomorrow morning.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="page-body">
  <div class="wrap">
    {% set playbooks = collections.playbook | reverse %}

    {% if playbooks.length > 0 %}
      <div class="pb-grid">
        {% for post in playbooks %}
        {% set isComing = "coming" in (post.data.status | lower) %}
        {% set pillarColor = "var(--ember)" if isComing else "var(--teal)" %}
        <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="pb-card" style="--pillar-color: {{ pillarColor }};">
          <span class="pb-status{% if isComing %} soon{% endif %}">{{ post.data.status or 'Available' }}</span>
          <h2 class="pb-title">{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
          {% if post.data.dek %}<p class="pb-dek">{{ post.data.dek }}</p>{% endif %}
          <div class="pb-foot">
            <span class="pb-read">{% if post.data.readingTime %}{{ post.data.readingTime }} read{% else %}Playbook{% endif %}</span>
            <span class="pb-arrow">→</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% else %}
      <p style="color: var(--t2); font-size: 18px;">Four playbooks are in development for 2026. Follow <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/sourcing-strategist/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--teal);">Brendan on LinkedIn</a> for release announcements, or subscribe to the <a href="/newsletters/" style="color: var(--teal);">Wednesday briefing</a>.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
